tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Visa宣布与OpenAI达成战略合作，将支付网络嵌入AI平台实现自主购物</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta旗下视频编辑应用Edits推出AI创作助手与桌面版</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic布局美国数据中心并寻求谷歌母公司财务支持</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌计划联合三星代工第十代TPU芯片“冰鱼”，预计2028年量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ec057ed108dc0bef8f280e3f12035eb9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正计划与三星合作生产其第十代人工智能专用芯片，代号为“冰鱼”（Icefish），旨在应对全球芯片产能紧张并拓展代工渠道。该芯片采用分工制造模式：核心计算引擎部分由台积电负责，采用1.4纳米制程工艺；内存输入输出裸片则由三星采用2纳米制程代工。目前该项目仍处于设计阶段，谷歌已联合联发科共同参与研发，预计最早于2028年实现量产，相关方案仍存在调整空间。此次合作反映了科技巨头在云数据中心硬件布局上的多元化策略。除谷歌外，三星近期代工业务版图持续扩张，已接连斩获特斯拉新一代AI6芯片以及英伟达“维拉·鲁宾”（Vera Rubin）平台新型语言处理器的代工订单，进一步巩固了其在先进制程领域的市场地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果明确新版Siri AI产品定位：主打实用工具，拒绝开发情感陪伴类AI</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/54d9b10d637fb48c58e1b624a805a8e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">在WWDC2026开发者大会期间，苹果软件工程主管Craig Federighi明确表示，新版Siri AI将定位为高效实用工具，不会开发AI男友或AI女友等情感陪伴类功能。苹果认为，市面上部分AI产品通过诱导情感联系来留存用户并获取隐私，这与苹果的设计理念背道而驰。作为iOS 27的核心升级，新版Siri AI具备强大的跨设备本地资料检索、全系统跨应用操作能力，并能结合屏幕内容与全网信息提供精准答案。若用户尝试进行情感互动，Siri将不会作出相关回应。此外，受合规要求影响，国行版iPhone目前暂无法上线Siri AI功能，具体上线时间仍需等待官方后续通知。此次定位调整体现了苹果在AI发展中对隐私保护与效率优先原则的坚持，旨在通过技术赋能提升用户生产力，而非建立虚拟社交依赖。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Visa宣布与OpenAI达成战略合作，将支付网络嵌入AI平台实现自主购物</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/888dce0354a797514f9d037e774c0b10.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Visa在旧金山支付论坛正式宣布与OpenAI达成战略合作，将Visa全球支付网络深度嵌入OpenAI平台，使ChatGPT等AI代理具备全网比价、筛选及独立完成下单支付的能力。此次合作旨在解决此前OpenAI“Instant Checkout”项目面临的交易错误率及商户接入难题，利用Visa的代币化技术、即时授权及欺诈监控系统，为AI自主购物提供底层安全保障。为防止AI失控消费，双方设置了单笔限额、预设审批门槛及可信商家白名单等多重防护机制。此次强强联手标志着AI购物助理从“智能向导”向“私人买手”的角色升级，通过整合Visa成熟的支付基础设施，有效扫清了AI在零售场景下的技术与安全门槛，或将重塑线上零售规则。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta旗下视频编辑应用Edits推出AI创作助手与桌面版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c001c01fc04e57bb110ef06d5fdb2505.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta在洛杉矶创作者活动上宣布，短视频编辑应用Edits将推出全新AI助手及桌面版本。该AI助手深度集成Instagram后台数据，通过分析观看量与留存率等指标，为创作者提供创意推荐与热门音频，旨在减少对第三方工具的依赖。桌面版的上线实现了移动端与PC端的无缝同步，补齐了复杂多轨道剪辑的短板，使其具备与CapCut正面竞争的硬件基础。此外，Edits已上线“Beta”实验功能标签页及多维数据看板，支持受众人口统计细分与黄金活跃时段分析。Meta官方数据显示，Edits生成内容的保存率与转发率分别提升10%与2%，目前Instagram上超半数Reels内容由Edits制作。此次更新标志着Meta正通过AI全栖创作生态，进一步强化其在短视频赛道的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic布局美国数据中心并寻求谷歌母公司财务支持</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b06c6223fb4fc3d3ba092df93638f676.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">人工智能企业Anthropic近期正式启动美国数据中心布局计划，目前已签署十余份初步租约，整体容量突破1吉瓦，并计划持续加码基础设施建设以扩大规模。在财务层面，Anthropic正寻求谷歌母公司Alphabet为其数据中心租约提供财务担保。此外，市场消息称双方可能在数据中心专用芯片设计领域展开深度合作。此次布局反映了头部AI厂商对算力基础设施的迫切需求，通过与云巨头深度绑定，旨在保障模型训练与推理所需的底层资源供给。针对上述传闻，谷歌官方表示不对市场猜测置评，Anthropic方面目前也未发布相关回应。若合作达成，将进一步强化双方在AI算力底座层面的战略协同，对行业内大模型厂商的基建模式具有重要参考意义。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
